      ],
      "source": "https://pennsylvaniagenealogy.org/bucks/kintnersville-pennsylvania.htm",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "A post office opened on February 11, 1849, with Samuel Boileau as its first postmaster.",
